flowchart TD
    accTitle: Notification ownership and error flow
    accDescr: An authenticated notification request uses an ownership-scoped conditional mutation and maps missing or non-owned resources to a safe notification-specific not-found Problem Details response.

    Request["Notification API request"] --> Security{"Authenticated?"}
    Security -->|No| Unauthorized["Existing shared 401 Problem Details"]
    Security -->|Yes| Controller["NotificationController"]
    Controller --> Service["Notification service"]
    Service --> Mutation["Ownership-scoped conditional SQL"]
    Mutation --> Rows{"Rows affected?"}
    Rows -->|"One"| Success["Existing success response"]
    Rows -->|"Zero"| Missing{"Missing resource?"}
    Rows -->|"Failure"| Internal["Existing generic 500 path"]
    Missing -->|"Notification"| NotificationError["Notification not found"]
    Missing -->|"Subscription"| SubscriptionError["Subscription not found"]
    NotificationError --> Neutral["ApplicationException + NotificationErrors"]
    SubscriptionError --> Neutral
    Neutral --> Adapter["RFC 9457 REST adapter"]
    Adapter --> Safe404["Ownership-private 404 Problem Details"]
